sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Payment Channel / POS
    participant Ingest as Transaction Ingestion
    participant Scorer as Risk Scoring Engine
    participant Orchestrator as Saga Orchestrator
    participant CardService as Core Banking (CBS)
    participant CaseService as Case Management
    participant NotifService as Notification Service
    participant AuditService as Merkle Audit Journal

    Client->>Ingest: POST /api/v1/transactions
    Ingest->>Scorer: Scatter-Gather Evaluation
    Scorer-->>Ingest: Risk Score = 840 (Action: AUTO_DECLINE)
    Ingest-->>Client: HTTP 200 (Decision: DECLINED)

    Note over Orchestrator: Trigger Fraud Investigation Saga (Orchestrated)
    Orchestrator->>CardService: Step 1: FreezeCard(card_hash)
    CardService-->>Orchestrator: Card Frozen OK
    Orchestrator->>CaseService: Step 2: CreateInvestigationCase(priority=P1)
    CaseService-->>Orchestrator: Case #8192 Created
    Orchestrator->>NotifService: Step 3: DispatchAlert(SMS + Push)

    alt Notification Gateway Times Out
        NotifService--xOrchestrator: Gateway Timeout (504)
        Note over Orchestrator: Initiating Saga Compensating Transactions!
        Orchestrator->>CaseService: Compensate: MarkCasePendingRetry(Case #8192)
        Orchestrator->>CardService: Compensate: Leave Card in Temporary Protective Hold
        Orchestrator->>AuditService: LogCompensationFailure(saga_id, error_reason)
    else Notification Success
        NotifService-->>Orchestrator: Alert Delivered OK
        Orchestrator->>AuditService: Step 4: AppendAuditLog(saga_id, status=COMPLETE)
        AuditService-->>Orchestrator: Merkle Root Hash Verified
    end
